0_0000_/status/1900831696267997628\n\nOutfit: Please use Tsuina's outift as the main reference and add Akari Ozora-san's outift details (crown, ribbons, etc)\nI would like it if her wings would be seen fully and if possible to also see her angel halo.\nPlease choose the facial expression as you wish! \n\nWould it be possible for me to receive art in a 16:9 square as it would be for this cover?\nPlease supply the psd with the background and character separated so it can be used for Youtube thumbnails, SNS and more!\n\nIf this request is not possible feel free to not accept! \nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ySSeTAwsvpFZ9MwY7Y2r4Wrb33XAswEA?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zer0_0000_/works/19", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/978928a1/uploads/origins/cc6ec546-79f1-4aa6-9af5-ab8c917e9ffa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b788b10719608564337a4ca7e8f4a172", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/978928a1/uploads/origins/cc6ec546-79f1-4aa6-9af5-ab8c917e9ffa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b788b10719608564337a4ca7e8f4a172, https://si.imgix.net/978928a1/uploads/origins/cc6ec546-79f1-4aa6-9af5-ab8c917e9ffa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7dcfca057636e45433470800ffb19310 2x, https://si.imgix.net/978928a1/uploads/origins/cc6ec546-79f1-4aa6-9af5-ab8c917e9ffa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5462af0e6371e79a23571461b73d43d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの絵はとてもかわいいので、私のキャラクターを描いていただけたら嬉しいです。ポーズや表情はお任せしますが、よろしいでしょうか？ありがとうございました！\n\n参考リンク：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-xfT0sA3MaZhskcxE65S2PWdXkPdeXUk/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@zer0_0000_/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f307b33/uploads/origins/00e78f04-4d60-47d1-8b2e-b87a4458c02d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%